{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 13,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lo, mine eye hath seen all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",\nMine ear hath heard and understood it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What ye know, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the same",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " do I know also:\nI am not inferior unto you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely I would speak to the Almighty,\nAnd I desire to reason with God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ye are forgers of lies;\nYe are all physicians of no value.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh that ye would altogether hold your peace!\nAnd it would be your wisdom.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear now my reasoning,\nAnd hearken to the pleadings of my lips.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Will ye speak unrighteously for God,\nAnd talk deceitfully for him?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Will ye show partiality to him?\nWill ye contend for God?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Is it good that he should search you out?\nOr as one deceiveth a man, will ye deceive him?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He will surely reprove you,\nIf ye do secretly show partiality.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Shall not his majesty make you afraid,\nAnd his dread fall upon you?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Your memorable sayings are proverbs of ashes,\nYour defences are defences of clay.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hold your peace, let me alone, that I may speak;\nAnd let come on me what will.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore should I take my flesh in my teeth,\nAnd put my life in my hand?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, he will slay me; I have no hope:\nNevertheless I will maintain my ways before him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This also shall be my salvation,\nThat a godless man shall not come before him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear diligently my speech,\nAnd let my declaration be in your ears.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold now, I have set my cause in order;\nI know that I am righteous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who is he that will contend with me?\nFor then would I hold my peace and give up the ghost.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Only do not two things unto me;\nThen will I not hide myself from thy face:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Withdraw thy hand far from me;\nAnd let not thy terror make me afraid.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then call thou, and I will answer;\nOr let me speak, and answer thou me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How many are mine iniquities and sins?\nMake me to know my transgression and my sin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore hidest thou thy face,\nAnd holdest me for thine enemy?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wilt thou harass a driven leaf?\nAnd wilt thou pursue the dry stubble?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thou writest bitter things against me,\nAnd makest me to inherit the iniquities of my youth:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou puttest my feet also in the stocks,\nAnd markest all my paths;\nThou settest a bound to the soles of my feet:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.13.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.13.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Though I am like a rotten thing that consumeth,\nLike a garment that is moth-eaten.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
